{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7042cd72401e10bc","name":"Skill Challenge Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-7042cd72401e10bc","title":"Skill Challenge Talent Tree","revision":21249,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:26:04Z","sha256":"c51ce1c608aa61731acf170d018f2b2bf23d122874836451bab7ef6e22b7c676","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21249","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Skill%20Challenge%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7042cd72401e10bc","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You excel at complex tasks and are always called upon when your allies need something done quickly and done right.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Guaranteed Boon"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to add to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," and accrue a Failure for that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", you regain that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Leading Skill"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you earn a Success in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", you gain a +2 insight bonus to your next ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," made with a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," in the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Learn from Mistakes"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you accrue a Failure in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", you grant the next ally to take an action in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," a +2 insight bonus to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", provided that the ally takes a different action (and uses a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},") than you did.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Try Your Luck"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you accrue a Failure in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", choose one ally. The next time that ally uses the same ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," that you used to accrue a Failure before the end of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"},", that ally rolls two dice on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
